# psi915 patch series for the upstream Linux import (quilt layout).
# scripts/import-linux.sh applies these in order with "patch -p1" from the repository root, so patch paths
# look like a/i915/drivers/gpu/drm/i915/... and b/i915/drivers/gpu/drm/i915/... (trees: drm, i915, gpl)
# One logical change per patch; name them NNNN-subsystem-summary.patch; each patch starts with a short
# description, the reason, and an "Upstream:" line (not-applicable / candidate / sent).
#
# Making a patch: scripts/import-linux.sh -P (pristine tree), commit or copy it, edit, then
#   git diff -- drm i915 gpl >third_party/patches/NNNN-....patch, add it here, re-run the import,
#   and check with scripts/import-linux.sh -c.
#
# drm/, i915/ and gpl/ equal upstream Linux v6.14 plus these patches; pristine blobs in IMPORT_FILES.
# Patches guard illumos code with CONFIG_PSI915 (third_party/config/gen9.config).  Planned ones: docs/08 3.4.
0001-i915-gemfs-no-tmpfs-mount.patch
0002-i915-rps-no-intel-ips-link.patch
0003-i915-mm-remap-via-lkpi-vma-insert-pfns.patch
0004-i915-ggtt-gmch-stub-intel-gtt.patch
0005-i915-pxp-gsccs-ready-stub-without-pxp.patch
